sequenceDiagram
  participant Hook as Host hook
  participant CLI as Executable
  participant Inv as Invocation owner
  participant Plan as Request planning
  participant Ev as Evidence
  participant Dec as Judgment owner
  participant Jev as Jev / OpenRouter
  Note over Hook,Jev: Proposed-only. Handoff monitor with a router over message and session
  Hook->>CLI: evaluate_rules: router path, one group, origin, cursor
  CLI->>Inv: RuleInvocationInput
  Inv->>Inv: admit router, routed RuleSets, rule lines, wiring
  Inv->>Ev: validate payload against agent-job-packet
  alt invalid definitions, bindings or payload
    Inv-->>CLI: invalid, no reads or calls (exit 2)
  else admitted
    Inv->>Inv: leading conditions per derived group
    Inv->>Plan: plan gates and requests
    Plan-->>Inv: router rides in review-handoff request, commission-completeness waits for router
    Inv->>Ev: capture transcript once, normalize, select declared projections
    Ev-->>Inv: labeled selections, gaps, new cursor
    Inv->>Dec: request: router + verdicts + informational questions
    Dec->>Dec: encode, assess budget, admit bytes
    Dec->>Jev: admitted body, bounded attempts
    alt completed
      Jev-->>Dec: answers and usage
      Dec-->>Inv: completed outcome
      Inv->>Inv: settle router slot, routed label decides waiting requests
      opt chosen label is commission: review-handoff answers discarded with cost
        Inv->>Dec: commission-completeness request, sent after the router settled
        Dec->>Jev: admitted body
        Jev-->>Dec: answers
        Dec-->>Inv: completed outcome
      end
    else provider failure or invalid response
      Dec-->>Inv: failed outcome, router slot failed, report incomplete
    end
    Note over Inv: Cancellation stops new requests, joins owned tasks, then admits the terminal outcome
    Inv->>Inv: reduce in authored order: router floor, entries, verdicts, bands
    Inv-->>CLI: report with verdicts, severities, requests, cursor
    CLI-->>Hook: stdout result, exit 0 complete or 3 incomplete
  end
